      { type: "p", text: "Whatever you decide, build the day around your children's energy rather than a fixed list. A rested family sees far more than an exhausted one, and a slower plan leaves room for the small, unplanned moments that children tend to remember best. Keep snacks and water within easy reach, check the venue's website for current hours and prices, and be ready to change course if the weather or anyone's mood demands it." },
      { type: "h2", text: "Final word" },
      { type: "p", text: "Ras Al Khaimah is best treated as a full day or an overnight stay. Give yourself time on the road, be realistic about what each child can do, and the mountains will reward you with one of the most memorable family days in the UAE." }
